      <ns0:documentation id="sid-94a9677e-5fa6-4bfa-950f-560aecda174e">Through this business procedure, a decision is made whether the applicant is to be accepted or rejected. This will be made on the basis of pre-defined specific criteria. </ns0:documentation>
